# S07-T04: Org Handbook — Documentation Layers

## Objective

Project-agnostic page: where each kind of documentation lives and who updates it.

## App-agent preflight (MANDATORY before code)

- [ ] MCP preflight — WARN if `:3000` down
- [ ] `explain("organization-planning")` + `explain("feature-knowledge")`
- [ ] `get-page("/company/totem-governance")` — cross-link T03 (must exist first)
- [ ] `list-apps` — enumerate apps for per-app docs row examples (generic, no deep dive)

## Implementation

- [ ] Create `docs/content/2.company/3.documentation-layers.md`
- [ ] Table (from `APP-AGENT-PROTOCOL.md` §3, org-focused):

| Layer | Path | Audience | Update when | MCP tool |
|-------|------|----------|-------------|----------|
| Organization handbook | `docs/content/2.company/` | People + agents | Governance change | `list-pages`, `get-page` |
| Brand config | `organization/app/app.config.ts` | All apps | Brand/roles | `get-file` |
| Feature knowledge | `core/docs/knowledge/{slug}.md` | AI | Platform change | `explain`, `record`, `census` |
| Per-app rules | `apps/<app>/docs/` | Devs + AI | App behavior | `get-app-structure` |
| Instance planning | totem `instances/<project>/` | PLANNER, PM | Each sprint | work-control |

- [ ] Explicit rule: organization layer does **not** auto-sync to knowledge or per-app docs
- [ ] MCP preflight section: when to WARN, `[static fallback]`, start command

## Done when (app-agent tools)

- [ ] `get-page("/company/documentation-layers")` — page exists
- [ ] `census()` — no regression on knowledge slugs
- [ ] Cross-links to totem-governance page work
